<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰστίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put into, place in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἔς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.100
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐς τὰς χεῖράς
			τινι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				208
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκρὸν ἐς ἅμαξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. <i>put
				on board</i> ship, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα
			ἐσθέντες</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς
				πεντηκοντέρους</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.164
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθέμενοι τέκνα καὶ
			γυναῖκας</span> ibid., cf.<i><span class="en">
				4.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1566
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.6.20
			</span></i> ; <i>to take,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς φορεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					4.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be entered,</i> of a judgement in court, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.39
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
